    "title": "Is Boise A Good College Town? Recent Ranking Reveals The Truth - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shanbot ,\n11 hours ago Credit: Google Maps One thing’s for sure, Boise has definitely grown. A lot of this probably has to do with Boise State. The school has definitely continued to grow and grow and who wouldn’t want to go to school in Boise?\nThere are a lot of things that can lead to people wanting to go to Boise State and a lot of it has to do with the city of Boise. There’s so much to do just all within an hour of the school. Whether it’s floating the Boise River in the summer, skiing and snowboarding in Bogus Basin in the winter, hiking Table Rock in the spring, or visiting the pumpkin patch in fall, Boise has activities that bring around the best type of people.\nBest College Towns 2025 Where will Boise fall on this list? Gallery Credit: Shannon Buccola Credit: Canva #1 Austin, TX #2 Ann Arbor, MI #3 Orlando, FL #4 Tampa, FL #5 Raleigh, NC #6 Tempe, AZ #7 Atlanta, GA #8 Reno, NV Credit: Canva #9 Charlottesvilla, VA #10 Gainesville, FL #23 Boise, ID\nBoise is the perfect mix of both nature and the outdoors and city life. Downtown Boise is all walkable with restaurants, bars, and concert venues that are both fun and provide great weekday and weekend entertainment. This gives a great appeal for those looking to move for coolege.\nBoise has always gotten recognition for being one of the best cities in the country. But now, it’s getting recognition for being such a great college town!\nIt’s awesome to see Boise cities make on the list, for the best college towns in America. There’s definitely a reason why people want to move here for the next 4ish years of their education. While it is in the top 25 of best college towns in America it is currently ranked #23. Maybe next year we’ll crack the top 10!\nCheck out the full rankings HERE .\nSee where a couple of Boise cities land in the ranking for safest cities in America.\nSafest Cities in America 2 Idaho cities made the top 20! Gallery Credit: Shannon Buccola Credit: Canva #! Warwick, RI Credit: Canva #2 Overland Park, KS Credit: Canva #3 Burlington, VT Credit: Canva #4 Juneau, AK #5 Yonkers, NY Credit: Canva #6 Casper, WY Credit: Canva #7 South Burlington, VT Credit: Canva #8 Columbia, MD Credit: Canva #9 Lewiston, ME Credit: Canva #10 Salem, OR Credit: Canva #11 Nashua, NH Credit: Canva #12 ★ Boise, ID Credit: Canva #13 Laredo, TX Credit: Canva #14 Santa Rosa, CA Credit: Canva #15 Virginia Beach, VA Credit: Canva #16 ★ Nampa, ID\nBoise State Blue Thunder Marching Band In Portland The band put on a great performance and everyone on the internet loved it! Gallery Credit: Shannon Buccola Credit: TikTok/_whodatbee Saw Boise State Marching Band They were putting on a show in Portland. Credit: TikTok/_whodatbee The Band They're aweseome. Credit: TikTok/_whodatbee Show They were performing great. Yeah BSU They show much love. Credit: TikTok/_whodatbee Okay Blue Thunder People cheer them on! Credit: TikTok/_whodatbee Good Job This an awesome compliment. Credit: TikTok/_whodatbee A Relief They wanted to bring joy to Portland. Credit: TikTok/_whodatbee They Sound Great! What a fun time. Credit: TikTok/_whodatbee Blue Thunder For The Win People love them!",
